  "Luxembourg's trade balance with China has become more negative since 2010.",
  "It was -19.8 million euros in 2010 and is projected to reach -633.9 million euros in 2025.",
  "The largest deficit was in 2013 at -18.8 million euros, after which the deficit grew significantly.",
  "The trade balance change from 2010 to 2025 is +3,104.4%.",
